Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}我想你 我想你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.30,0:22:03.21,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}I need you   I need you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.30,0:22:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}我要你 我要你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.42,0:22:05.66,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}Sexy Sexy
